**How to implement.** One serializer options value, owned by a new canonical-JSON module (001 §B: the System.Text.Json + FSharp.SystemTextJson + JsonSchema.Net stack in `ProjectJson` is REUSED; .spec-md §5 'Canonical JSON + SHA-256', §6 'JSON + schema'). This step is a MOVE and changes no output. (1) New `OpticalConstructor.Storage/CanonicalJson.fs`, `module CanonicalJson` in `namespace OpticalConstructor.Storage`, compiled directly after `SchemaValidation.fs` and before `ProjectJson.fs` (`OpticalConstructor.Storage.fsproj:22-23`): one `<Compile Include="CanonicalJson.fs" />` line and no new comment. `ProjectJson.options` (`ProjectJson.fs:125-145`) and its five private converters (`BeamBranchConverter`, `RotationLockConverter`, `BeamPresenceConverter`, `ToggleStateConverter`, `ComplexMatrixConverter`, `ProjectJson.fs:24-123`) MOVE there verbatim. Their docs say that this is the one options value every JSON store of the app reads. They are deleted from `ProjectJson.fs`, whose `parseProject` and `serializeProject` (`:158-182`) now read `CanonicalJson.options`; any `open` that is no longer used goes. (2) Every other reader re-points, with no other change: `GroupsLibrary.fs` (`:82`, `:90`, `:93`), `RecentFiles.fs` (`:55`, `:70`), the three reads in `Report.fs` module `MaterialLibrary` (`importMaterials` / `exportMaterials`), `OpticalConstructor.Ui/UserEnvironment.fs` (`:367`, `:377`, `:380`) and `OpticalConstructor.Tests/DispersionModelsTests.fs` (`AC-D8 only dndT and referenceTemperature persist through JSON (operating T unstored)`). The inventory's census of `ProjectJson.options` is exactly these files and `ProjectJson.fs`. (3) Every comment that names the moved value or one of its converters names `CanonicalJson` instead: `GroupsLibrary.fs:17` and `:86`, `RecentFiles.fs:12`, the two `Report.fs` docs that name the shared options, `UserEnvironment.fs:13`, `:141`, `:250` and `:373`, `OpticalConstructor.Ui/Localization.fs:39`, `OpticalConstructor.Domain/Groups.fs:16`, `:23` and `:123`, and `OpticalConstructor.Domain/Placement.fs:279`. No other comment is swept. Afterwards `git grep -n -F "ProjectJson.options" -- Berreman/` finds nothing. No converter is added and no option changes, so every existing JSON round-trip fact (`ProjectJsonRoundtripTests`, `RoundTripTests`, `GroupsRoundTripTests`, `EnvironmentRoundTripTests`, `ExportImportTests`, `DispersionModelsTests`) passes unchanged.

**Acceptance.** After the move, `CanonicalJson.options` MUST be the only serializer options value, with nothing under Berreman/ naming `ProjectJson.options`, and every existing JSON round-trip fact MUST pass unchanged; and build, elevation, constructor-unit-tests, ui-smoke, the selected ui-tests classes and the six s04 invariants MUST pass.
